ATA[Quote of the day by Sir Isaac Newton: "We build too many walls and not enough…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133401498.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/quote-of-the-day-by-sir-isaac-newton-we-build-too-many-walls-and-not-enough-simple-reminder-behind-the-barriers-we-create/articleshow/133401498.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/quote-of-the-day-by-sir-isaac-newton-we-build-too-many-walls-and-not-enough-simple-reminder-behind-the-barriers-we-create/articleshow/133401498.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-21T17:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133402349,imgsize-135420.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists find a new frog species hidden in a museum drawer for a century]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133401868.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a surprising revelation, a common frog species from Ecuador and Colombia remained misnamed for more than a century. Researchers uncovered this taxonomic blunder through a careful review of historical museum specimens and identified it as Pristimantis milpe. This finding underscores the vital role that archived collections play in advancing scientific knowledge and correcting longstanding misconceptions in taxonomy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/scientists-found-a-new-species-hiding-in-a-museum-drawer-for-more-than-a-century-the-ecuadorian-frog-had-been-mistaken-for-another-species/articleshow/133401868.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/scientists-found-a-new-species-hiding-in-a-museum-drawer-for-more-than-a-century-the-ecuadorian-frog-had-been-mistaken-for-another-species/articleshow/133401868.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-21T18:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133402379,imgsize-493933.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Carl Linnaeus: "I well know what a splendidly great diff.."]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133401683.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/quote-of-the-day-by-carl-linnaeus-i-well-know-what-a-splendidly-great-difference-there-is-between-a-man-and-a-bestia-when-i-/articleshow/133401683.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/quote-of-the-day-by-carl-linnaeus-i-well-know-what-a-splendidly-great-difference-there-is-between-a-man-and-a-bestia-when-i-/articleshow/133401683.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-21T16:14:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133401912,imgsize-108736.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[18-year-old Kentucky student creates smart gel for drug delivery]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133402517.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-vallabh-ramesh-the-18-year-old-kentucky-student-who-created-a-3d-printable-smart-gel-that-solidifies-at-body-temperature-and-could-one-day-deliver-drugs-inside-the-body/articleshow/133402517.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-vallabh-ramesh-the-18